WEBVTT

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:59.470
December, Kan'ei Year 10 (1633 AD)...

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:35.420
Due to conduct unbecoming the lord of a large domain...

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:40.010
...Tokugawa Tadanaga was ordered to commit seppuku...

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:45.470
...despite his standing as Shogun Iemitsu's younger brother.

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:49.230
However, many tales of his misconduct are stories passed on...

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:51.850
...which were never confirmed to be true.

00:02:55.190 --> 00:03:01.280
<b>Chapter One: Sword Match At Sunpu Castle</b>

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:07.290
Kan'ei Year 6 (1629 AD)... Sunpu Castle...

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:14.920
There is something that I would like to say to you, my Lord.

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:22.800
Something smells...

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:35.860
This is a request that I would like
to get you to accept at any cost, so...

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:43.530
About the match that will be held
before you on September 24th within the castle...

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:46.870
Please do not make the swordsmen...

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:50.540
...use real swords.

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:59.000
The level of their swordsmanship
can be shown using wooden swords.

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:03.590
Having them use real swords means skilled swordsmen will be...

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:18.480
The country is already at peace.

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:19.900
If we violate the garden of Sunpu Castle...

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:22.570
...a castle that is connected to Tosho-Daigongen-sama...

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:26.070
...with blood in a time like this...

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:29.450
...it will be seen as defiance towards the government.

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:32.290
If that happens,
it will be a matter of grave concern to his lordship's family.

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:38.880
For that reason, in lieu of those swordsmen, I will show it to you!

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:55.480
The result of a match using real swords is...

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:59.020
...something like this...

00:05:00.770 --> 00:05:02.860
Or, are you, my Lord...

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:06.740
...saying that you want to see this, even if it costs you Suruga...

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:11.040
...a domain worth 550 thousand koku?!

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:29.720
Foolish Lord...

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:48.700
September 24, the same year...

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:09.510
Indeed, it is pointless...

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:15.180
...to lose valuable skilled samurai in a match using real swords...

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:21.690
However...

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:25.150
Who can stop our Lord...

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:33.950
...when even the admonition by Torii-dono,
who sacrificed his life, was ignored...

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:42.960
After all... a samurai's life is not his own.

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:59.230
Having a place to die for his lord is
indeed an honor to a samurai family.

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:15.740
Note: West

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:42.810
Mie-dono...

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:44.100
What is the matter?

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:48.610
I saw...

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:53.610
...you winning the match.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:00.620
Fujiki Gennosuke-dono...

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:03.120
It's time for your match.

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:30.030
We will now start the match before our Lord!

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:35.660
Yes, sir.

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:41.790
On the west! Fujiki Gennosuke!

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:51.800
One-armed!

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:56.430
If I remember correctly, that man was...

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:59.470
...recommended by you, Saegusa-dono.

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:00.810
Correct.

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:02.810
Have you lost your mind?

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:05.440
A one-armed swordsman fighting a match with real swords is...

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:07.310
Possible!

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:10.900
Hyuga-dono!

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:15.070
Oh.

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:18.620
You use the Kogan Style,
which is said to be unrivaled in the Noubi area.

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:21.490
Fujiki Gennosuke-dono...

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:26.460
You come recommended by Chief
Retainer Saegusa-sama, the Lord of Izu, correct?

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:32.630
Just to be safe, I will inspect your body.

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:35.470
Please, take your time.

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:44.810
A defeat wound!

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:50.480
Is it all right to bring such a man before our Lord?

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:08.080
I thought the rise on his back would make up for his missing arm.

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:20.470
On the East! Irako Seigen!

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:32.150
Iku...

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:35.150
I'll be fine.

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:53.920
Crippled!

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:57.130
That's not all.

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:00.130
He's blind!

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:10.770
Fujiki Gennosuke, Irako Seigen...

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:13.110
Please exhibit without hesitation...

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:16.940
...the entirety of your sword skills for our Lord.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:47.970
A one-armed man against a blind man...

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:53.650
Violating the garden with this
show unworthy to be called martial arts...

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:55.230
There is no excuse...

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:56.150
No.

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:58.940
Look, Asakura-dono.

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:03.410
To a swordsman with an unbending spirit...

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:11.660
...having a cruel fate given to him
indeed stirs his soul and it will finally...

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:32.690
W-What is that stance?

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:38.690
That is Irako-sama's certain victory stance...

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:42.530
Mumyo Sakanagare!

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:48.080
Fujiki-sama...

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:49.700
Please slay him...

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:55.670
Please slay Irako, whom I detest...

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:58.840
...I detest so much...

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:09.470
<b>They can... They can do it...</b>

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:39.540
You damn monster!

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:17.920
I can't... read their swordsmanship...

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:22.960
Their swordplay is... abnormal...

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:38.850
Note: Iwamoto Dojo for the Kogan Style

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:47.990
Seven years ago...

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:52.700
Genna Year 8 (1622 AD) Tootoumi Province...

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:18.180
Fujiki is gonna do it... His Tsuba-Zemari...

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:23.190
That one is tough since you can't even say "I give up."

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:26.980
I give...

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:41.460
That is enough!

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:45.960
Fujiki...

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:51.470
Can't you...

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:53.890
How should I say it...

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:56.060
Take it a little easy on them?

00:15:56.060 --> 00:15:57.470
Instructor Ushimata...

00:15:57.930 --> 00:16:00.310
They won't learn unless it hurts...

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:05.980
Reporting!

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:09.030
A man with another style came to the entrance just now!

00:16:26.340 --> 00:16:28.380
My name is Irako Seigen.

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:32.380
I would like to have a match with Iwamoto Kogan-sensei.

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:39.640
Father!

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:41.390
Father!

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:43.140
A man with another style came to the dojo!

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:47.520
Master...

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:51.030
No...

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:54.200
Please, I beg you...

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:16.430
Father!

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:28.520
Challenging our dojo!

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:37.450
Okay. I will let Sensei know.

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:39.780
However, based of our dojo rules...

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:44.580
...it will be after you have a match with two apprentices.

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:49.380
That will be fine.

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:06.140
Rules for matches against swordsmen with another style...

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:11.770
...since we have the matches as part of our training...

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:14.940
Regardless of the outcome of the match...

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:21.240
...we should never hold a grudge.

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:28.460
Treat swordsmen with another style courteously...

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:34.800
And killing them... is not allowed.

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:39.550
We should give them a new look and send them back.

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:47.060
Their appearance will show
the world that "the Kogan style is strong"...

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:50.980
...and will increase the dojo's fame.

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:53.480
Unnecessary...

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:56.030
Unnecessary...

00:18:57.190 --> 00:18:59.530
That bastard's red lips...

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:04.120
...are unnecessary for swordplay!

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:10.370
It seems that the point of Fujiki's sword is a little fired up...

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:18.510
That bastard... jumped in...

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:22.050
Now! Tsuba-Zemari!

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:23.510
I'll crush him!

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:30.140
He missed his chance!

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:39.650
What's going on?

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:40.650
Hm?

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:43.160
Something is odd with Fujiki.

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:56.550
That's... Yubi Garami...

00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:04.800
That's enough.

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:10.180
Assistant Instructor!

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:12.060
Assistant Instructor Fujiki!

00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:18.730
It's nothing!

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:20.070
It's not over yet.

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:28.040
I-It's not over yet! It's not...

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:30.700
Is that so?

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:42.340
I said that was enough.

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:46.800
It's not over yet... It's not over yet...

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:47.720
Fujiki...

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:49.350
It's not...

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:56.190
I know...

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:28.720
I'm up next.

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:51.910
I see it's a wooden sword for practice strokes.

00:22:00.630 --> 00:22:03.920
Pardon me for my bad manners.

00:22:10.100 --> 00:22:14.980
<b>End: Sword Match At Sunpu Castle</b>

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:49.820
<b>Next Chapter: The Yodare-Azuki Ceremony</b>
